import Writ.Core.Reason

namespace Writ

def Reason.modelMessage : Reason → String
  | .notStarted => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it has not opened the session yet). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .alreadyStarted => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it tried to open a session that is already open). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .sessionEnded => "This session has ended, so no more tool calls can run in it. Do not repeat this request; tell the user the session is over."
  | .staleSeq => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it delivered events out of order). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .timeDecreasing => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (its clock went backwards). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .stateVersionMismatch => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it acted on an out-of-date copy of the session). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .policyDigestMismatch => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (the session was opened under other rules than the ones loaded). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .duplicateCall => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it reused the identifier of a different call). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .unknownCall => "This refers to a tool call that was never proposed. Propose the call first if you still need it."
  | .staleRequest => "This answers an approval request or review that is out of date, because things changed since it was made. Do not repeat it; propose the call again if you still need it."
  | .unknownApprover => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (an approval came from someone this session does not know). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .callAwaiting => "This call is still waiting for approval. Do not repeat it; wait for the approval decision."
  | .callAuthorized => "This call is approved and has not run yet. Do not ask for approval again or repeat it."
  | .callDispatched => "This call is running and has no result yet. Do not run it again; wait for its result."
  | .callUnknown => "It is not known whether this call ran. Do not repeat it until you have checked, or asked the user, whether it took effect."
  | .callEnded => "This call has already finished. Do not repeat it; propose a new call if you need one."
  | .alreadyReconciled => "The outcome of this call is already recorded and final. Do not report it or run it again."
  | .retryNotAllowed => "This call may already have run, and its tool must not run twice. Do not run it again; check with the user whether it took effect."
  | .notEscalated => "Nothing is paused, so there is nothing to clear. Do not repeat this."
  | .approverChanged => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (an approver was registered again with different details). Your request was not the cause; do not repeat it, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .approverNotEligible => "This approver may not approve this call. Wait for an approval from an eligible approver."
  | .alreadyApproved => "This approver already approved this call. Do not send the same approval again."
  | .digestMismatch => "The call's contents differ from what was reviewed. Run only the exact call that was reviewed, or propose the changed call for review."
  | .costMismatch => "The cost is missing or differs from what was reviewed. Run only the exact call that was reviewed, or propose the changed call for review."
  | .editNotAllowed => "This call cannot be changed during approval. Approve or reject it as proposed."
  | .duplicateGrant => "A grant with this id already exists, so no new grant was made. Do not repeat this; only an approver can create a grant."
  | .unknownGrant => "No grant with this id exists, so there was nothing to revoke. Do not repeat this; only an approver can revoke a grant."
  | .grantNotAllowed => "This tool cannot be covered by a grant, or the grant goes beyond the policy limits. Do not repeat this; an approver must approve each call or create a grant within the limits."
  | .attemptOrder => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it counted tries of this call out of order). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .idempotencyKeyMismatch => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (a duplicate-protection key for this call changed between tries). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .attemptLimit => "This call has used all its allowed tries. Do not run it again; propose a new call if you still need it."
  | .turnState => "The system that runs tool calls hit an internal error (it acted as if a turn was open or closed when it was not). Your request was not the cause; do not change or repeat it on your own, and tell the user if this keeps happening."
  | .killed => "The session has been stopped. Do not retry this or any other call."
  | .escalated => "Calls are blocked after repeated problems. Do not retry until a person reviews the problems and clears the block."
  | .unknownTool => "This tool is not part of the policy. Do not call it again; use only the tools you have been given."
  | .notExposed => "This tool is not available to you. Do not call it again."
  | .proposalLimit => "You have made too many proposals this turn. Do not propose more until the next turn."
  | .stepLimit => "You have used all your steps for this turn. Stop and wait for the next turn."
  | .permissionMissing => "This session lacks the permission this tool needs. Do not retry; ask the user to grant the permission first."
  | .guardFalse => "A safety condition for this tool is not met right now. Do not retry until the user resolves it; tell the user what is blocking."
  | .costMissing => "This tool needs a cost and none was given. If the tool takes an amount from you, include it; otherwise tell the user."
  | .currencyMismatch => "The cost currency does not match the tool's budget. If the tool takes a currency from you, use the right one; otherwise tell the user."
  | .costAbovePerCall => "This call costs more than the policy allows for one call. Do not retry it; choose a smaller or cheaper action."
  | .meterExceeded => "This call would go over a spending or usage limit. Do not retry; ask the user to raise the limit or wait for it to reset."
  | .previouslyRejected => "The user rejected this exact call. Do not propose it again until the user sends a new message; ask the user what they want instead."
  | .approvalBudget => "You have asked for too many approvals this turn. Do not ask again until the next turn."
  | .approvalExpired => "The approval request expired before anyone answered. Ask the user whether to try again before you propose it again."
  | .authorizationExpired => "The approval for this call has expired. Ask the user to approve again before you retry."
  | .grantInvalid => "The grant covering this call is no longer valid. Ask the user for a new approval or grant before you retry."
  | .ledgerConflict => "The usage records changed elsewhere, so this session cannot continue. Do not retry anything in this session; tell the user the session is over."
  | .sessionProposalLimit => "This session has reached its proposal limit. Do not propose more calls."
  | .sessionApprovalBudget => "This session has reached its approval request limit. Do not ask for more approvals."

